# This catalog ships plugin sources verbatim, and sync_from_pydeck.py compares
# them byte-for-byte against a live PyDeck install — which always writes LF. A
# CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true, the Git for Windows default) therefore makes
# every text file read as changed, so a single sync bumps the patch version of
# every plugin in the catalog and publishes version folders with no real diff.
#
# Pin the working tree to LF on every platform. This overrides core.autocrlf, so
# it holds for any clone regardless of the cloner's settings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets Git must not touch or diff as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
